Trademark notice
----------------

Overwatch is a demonstration project. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by,
or connected to Capitec Bank Holdings Limited or any other organisation whose
name, brand or colour scheme appears in it.

The UI is themed to resemble Capitec's public brand for the purposes of a
portfolio demonstration. The mark drawn in overwatch-ui/src/components/Brand.jsx
is an eye-matched approximation drawn from scratch, not an official asset, and
the MIT grant above covers this project's own source only — it conveys no right
to any third party's trademarks.

The sign-in screen is a mock. It authenticates nothing, sends nothing anywhere,
and must not be deployed anywhere it could be mistaken for a real bank's login.
